{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a3ce0eb35f9176382260d30d0f25dc139f193a7e6e65d0e12dc07a11030bd42e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["揭开第七印"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["羔羊揭开第七印时，天上寂静无声，约半小时。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["然后，我看见站在上帝面前的七位天使领受了七支号角。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["另一位天使手里拿着金香炉上前来，站在祭坛旁边。他接过了许多香，把香和众圣徒的祈祷一起献在宝座前的金坛上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["这香冒出的烟，连同众圣徒的祷告从那天使的手中向上升到上帝面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使又拿着香炉，盛满祭坛的火，将它倒在地上，于是出现雷鸣、巨响、闪电和地震。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["天使吹号"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这时，那七位拿着号角的天使也预备要吹号。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一位天使吹响了号角，有冰雹和火掺杂着血被抛到地上。地的三分之一、树木的三分之一和一切青草都被烧毁了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二位天使吹响了号角，有一座好像燃烧的大山被扔进海里。海洋的三分之一变成了血，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["海中的活物死了三分之一，船只也被毁了三分之一。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["第三位天使吹响了号角，有一颗好像火炬般燃烧着的巨星从天上坠落在三分之一的河流和水泉里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["这颗星名叫“苦艾”，它使三分之一的水都变苦了，许多人因为喝了这种苦水而死去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["第四位天使吹响了号角，太阳、月亮和星辰的三分之一都受到重击，以致失去了三分之一的光辉，于是日间的三分之一暗淡无光，夜间也是如此。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我又看见有一只鹰在半空中飞翔，听见它大声宣告：“有祸了！有祸了！世上的居民有祸了！还有三位天使要吹响号角。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}